{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1383,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:463b338efa55675ffa0dee94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得现在的我跟夏天很搭吗？\r\n因为你看！在碧海蓝天下，\r\n有蓝色的诗歌剧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e004d7a19f2f11f60fe66b6d3c5312105c67cba43eafa5e01e1e5d0d95584528",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4ff07ee1e0dc87c152b1769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要去町内会办的秋季祭典？\r\n我有一件机密消息，听说……\r\n那里的团子好像可以吃到饱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "504caaac57ecffd0a5b0483c5aa065caf48c3ba27050eb580f1d5490a138249a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:843efe31afea9f93c993c170",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然肚子和手臂有一点冷，\r\n不过脚的部分还挺温暖的哦！\r\n因为你看，毛茸茸的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdb7d9168af94c33140eb1f368d89bed23a71434ae60215c6d446549ec16db1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ee0f2416fdf0c3dd71ed5a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵锵！\r\n你知道这个MT代表什么意思吗～？\r\n没错！就是诗歌剧（MachiTan）～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeb563bb3a19dd24f05596494840a6ba74ffff5ace9d7610e77331e9dac0d8ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdd5e8f74e0756e974fb8b05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，请看。\r\n我的头发和尾巴都很柔顺。\r\n柔顺、柔顺、柔顺顺～",
      "source_fingerprint": "356eae1793da323315c108313430a9661aca6cb362f394f336d0599b9a564566",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d23c3d5ba0936eef004d92e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备工作充分做好了哦～！\n快快，开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8a07ee117d9211053f2c8f339d7c129da0fb2e8c36d85e5005d0356eb21d59b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bb63c14e3a7b810f73079c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張るよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c61cd020f36a57f9e858b761603be4758421e3441eed0dabeb722fec8d21bb41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da86740649d950da5f264a41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "注意到的事要好好记下来！\n什么时候开始都可以哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9055535efc1050d6ba6801e34b61b3ee3231fac115504f4af538a4d470ae261d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1139feea38a4e9bf390a9e4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练，训练♪\n今天的训练是什么呢，\n哟嘿咻♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe549d9a55842720d76ef5a6cdfc65c8c277e0a572f50c1ac01de4f29583aaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de48abf217cea38fd8d6243",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你看看我超乎寻常\n的奔跑吧！\n嘻嘻，开～玩笑的～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ee1e1b19cbd649f6b020be4cee431551aee05a4aecab79206c396d5332eb7f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0e68f1975104487976e7957",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么都可以告诉我哦！\n训练员说的话一定\n是对的！所以。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f36820704b21856a38ae9885c2d865e33374e5e6ffd0639db06d5a1befa6af32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:545b31ada5c2c63a47f91804",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的训练计划\n请告诉我。每天都很期待\n看到那个哦～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "406eaaa47fd146214bc2473561a2291519f04e36dc57d98d4f8a43a1468dccaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3fead8cfd5fb439e4549792",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员在旁边的话，\n就能比平常加倍加倍\n加倍加ー倍地努力！呣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b60153100fd11272e3e502d42c3a48e82dc148532a2ab3e658f0c28e8a85c8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b3851091f0957b27851c459",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吼吼ー！集训，集训！\n在训练开始之前，\n想光着脚在沙滩上跑啊～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dd4d4032363146dd37f630765d0437f2fa0fbab47dc4b6a04493db2a6e88090",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9dea8324814f8f35807d975",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有必胜护身符！\r\n迈向胜利～预备～开始──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de906de86443679f9018216423c2e8e132bfeb86c799ba945b248522c84910cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b486b27557ea7c5de2bae3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一字巾绑好！手套戴好！\r\n今天也要跑步啰～要跑起来啰～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba170924af3c71f315c9f09e837d91e90feab8860b8bde202a38fa727a01d91a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c08231cc1f1bc49128ebd1a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会努力的──！\r\n毕竟就算是我，\r\n也会有为我声援的人在呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65e058a01804448570f49cfe50b0f41d4f21377222b60d4e8f2f9535cee60c35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab062bc9e17b242aacb62bb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别看我这样，我可是很强壮的！\r\n不论是怎样的训练，都尽管来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b14fc273fd83902036f354d98dfe50a9d3ece48afd629e3f60d9dfce61df268a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c0afbd2ce8e4babc18bd903",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干劲全满！真希望今后\r\n我们两个也能够继续展现出\r\n亮眼的表现给大家看呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd4e43a8796b1a92023b117e758555277ee32c0a332a2e8720877647e7230ea4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6250a9a395e2d5c032218235",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天，要大声地\r\n去向为我们加油的人们道谢哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7b66f3e8d54ebfffb968895fb54a2177545203b4b83edd652620cd403f5daa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef51308c54270080fe2a83f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我认为只要有情谊在，\r\n不论什么难关都能克服！\r\n……耶嘿，说说而已啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ff428aaeb20a227546e3274c8d9ebc9be19845af19fa1fbd31ec736f4673f85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec283a279901f2be97d40ad6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为是与训练员一起的特别时间…\n这份喜悦也要平分！嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9974817aede428312cf6d2cc5de05ec8b55395205699aab790a74340c7e27eae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22d1fd121c17189c4de114ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿…我，充分努力了吧，呣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c197953268ae6226605fe991d19525b1847a8aa835095073b273a9fb921cd618",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e290d0614d9cd3fc44e61679",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我与训练员间的情谊之力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcee3367a2d92d8fe8e1dbf91a85f70e938b812c4a273087fe33071d3d7007a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1017c4b65cb1bcec2db4c05c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我尽力了！给自己一个花章！姆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bc231e2a9e88f248fb14560703933eacd7735ef9d4909ec6251c80d22fb21e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77f1031db0fce0190fafaca9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘻嘻…还能继续前进呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4801ba6afb8923eb17669d03fa2fca3b42ce502833d2698413d5a4d233d568c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3d4b29b77062edaa2b30aa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能就这样结束！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a7c7e45b804b46234fe67dfb2b44d89d52825ab0307a7ecf96a595d097939e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90e85588274c2f2d099c06dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是待兼诗歌剧！请关关照照哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fbe89653ad8a8d24bd8c823f479949fe5b9ea3bfcc20997ec5701ad0a05c413",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e55ea120a943185debe1b11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能帮上更多忙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad1bd672d11a1338b131b8086eb0140ffedb557978309711c0c7715f851ff08b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adde317b41d996bb6d6cf3d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "依赖我也可以哦！嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a454b4323e8a7798044089e3e3e0a713981242815fd721281e26082042ed901c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:404bcb1606b95a0498723c16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诗歌剧之力，提升！锵锵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa7f2961646acf48495180e1234e3debde7ea61b98f9f50709a92ff6ebc5910b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7597a21ef7bb3d82e2b3902",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放心交给我！\r\n看我全～部接住！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7192890889f30af7d7567266bd2b61d9dc85b174b2df5af9bcd9902da197813e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38b3de30d1deb60baa1acf72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我接到大家的声援了！\r\n加油、加油、加油～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76674417a98ff8eef85803acb67bdb90072f3bc0e183691f595d9a3e32177317",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e26eaa83bbc364066938d26c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是待兼诗歌剧！总之，\r\n要不要来围成一圈鼓舞士气？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c45be6dd30645080706bc11cd56be51543e882d30e4cbc030b84fd0b754c45ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69cd1c3f1ee907a4c34d5c5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "時間です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c2c1bcc72a4ae9f88060fcccb1a351bee84241e14492d09ca0748435672cdc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f73dbf1727438b56c6195ab5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつまでも…どこまでも…。\r\n共に走り勝ってゆく。貴方の言葉に\r\nそんな未来が想像できたのです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "546c64388e4aa82adf67cc0d5910312d106d868b366fa6d2c4308128b5ca128f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ba9703f39ffdc1ffd2dac24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "それでは。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74c084993ca158e501ad05177ade9fd0503cbb43e1770a8aab310eba4edfad44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7f68e158f8d611a6b75f155",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e5bc0c07412060c2d22022d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方は不思議な人です…。理解\r\nしがたいこともある。だからこそ、\r\n傍で貴方を理解してみたいのです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0e4ccafdbe9ba4e43fe3fc5109881324518244c6483f5793095dae616ce2f21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f417d1b25ccb983d4b9288d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏のそよ風とコーヒーの香り…。\r\n時々、思い出します。またいつか、\r\n遠くへ漕ぎ出したいですね。…共に",
      "source_fingerprint": "996dedae0c96471160b4dfb26d565bb53c3532852919e76e1779334df66384f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45f117c7ae5ee8b158ea537d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本年もよろしくお願い申し上げます\r\nでは、福笑いに凧揚げ羽根つき…\r\n正月行事をとことん満喫しましょう",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9db97f25b721c4637d91cb980fc1443e3645de01d114da58005c61d28b97ba4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a2566ff69d13aa2301432e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“友チョコ”を用意する数が\r\n想定よりも増えていました…。\r\nこれは、実に嬉しい想定外です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a6e68852997b24de4d504899a6559f1e95bf5cc5a741ec14ae89952d7250b26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5a8cfe327883446d092a0d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "試行錯誤を重ね、美味しいチョコが\r\nできたと思うのですが…好みも\r\nありますし…お口に合うでしょうか",
      "source_fingerprint": "44bfc467e6aff0628805382fadee78dca1f61e5fc2659f0f0c1005b3c2e5628e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c73de6e07d458fd6b71e792",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕…短冊に願いを記し成就を祈る\r\n言葉にすることで、自身の目標を\r\n再確認できるのはよいですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f3ae7497034d1972b8dbc0fe5a1142980b09080474f43765543b81127d00a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d3a808ea7102ef139314c87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トリックオアトリートと言いますが\r\n私はイタズラをしてみたいですね。\r\n握手をした手がとれる、など…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c571d706cbc1b1b9a29667d7515cf1e3bc41e40b1a41344ab18ef6ce2c9aead0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0855db32c29a8e0e7e737af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1年で最も忙しい季節…だからこそ\r\n予定を組むのにも力が入ります。\r\n共によいクリスマスを迎えましょう",
      "source_fingerprint": "068566a503182520ba1026d44e5519201ddb436643aede866a48288e8dbd18f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fd64b9cb20999dd40ad1066",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼントは、お気に召していただ\r\nけるかと…友人たちに協力いただき\r\n最適な贈り物を導き出せましたので",
      "source_fingerprint": "83551ea48d2de37a2ad41c7f6921c614bc41c634d26b16db2cb24dd1e422d760",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c24e69a9e01c28dbf62a8e10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上々の結果です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2546f30de1a67103edd64d5722dd4588b92b89a93121c04b973ac34f63f68aa3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:716a9c7a3de53fd12154bb47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年末の大掃除はトレーナー室から。\r\n卓上、窓、壁、床と高い場所より\r\n順に埃を落としていきましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a5989e2507420432dff068398ff2519b13b2a100f10716fa1425a5635e1a40c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:932f4152d886b5a32afc6433",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お誕生日のお祝いに、特製ケーキを\r\nご用意しました。生地に野菜を練り\r\n込んでおり栄養バランスは完璧です",
      "source_fingerprint": "959de19484d66614469031da75e78ead207bdee8a8595be9427d132aa763ca56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b664077a1b19271eb2504bda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誕生日にサイクルボトルを贈ります\r\n遠出には水分補給が必要ですので。\r\n…その…次の休日のご予定は…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c34fe14ccf8e09b2724ab0f05b104343757a993697c7e184422fe3e849724b2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2362ce00f5cf571480cb61ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ネイチャさんの手料理、ターボさん\r\nのダンス、タンホイザさんの一発芸\r\n…ふふ、楽しい誕生日会でした。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba23cb3ab465092c9a5b8dc49e76bed7f42acd528deac6f4e4486f3ab912959",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b3aa262d113e77430446fc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誕生日プレゼント…？…日々、共に\r\n歩んでくださる、それが何よりの\r\n贈り物です。どうか、これからも…",
      "source_fingerprint": "891db073191c0abfd07f590d474a6ee4e682290bb1418412e9a7c617ae4213e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98dec49088455a1d07334fc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お知らせが届いているようです。\r\n重要な案件かもしれません。\r\n早急に確認すべきかと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19e8d913ec4d5720980e1d56b5e469e8ab178a57a340c593f5d97d9982d08ed5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d33715a56c1f5c9bb47113cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼントが届いているようです。\r\nすぐ確認されるようでしたら、\r\nお持ちしますよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bac693ddbb090c8ef371fb5097f898e1699a64cf4cc2bde38b2bfe6f148a535",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67e82c91a416e56836ded29c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミッション達成です。達成内容は\r\nこちらで記録しておきますので、\r\n報酬の受け取りをお願いできますか",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cef260257a73aa0b12e3edec44d6d0a102b1f6f6030b734fba355e3bbf0da18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4432bff93265813b2744c133",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントが開催されるようですね。\r\nスケジュールは余裕をもって\r\n組んでおくことにしましょうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46bcec828693396ec11e3867be36d738bdcab39fcd649cbe598c0169a63d9a86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a9957d58e165325f370dfcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントが催されているようです。\r\nスケジュールに余裕はありますので\r\n是非、楽しまれてみては？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5132b2d8ac9e235dad1fa2e9c79094db1c7a77ff94765bbc51676fabb518c833",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ae6e5db3161eeeb6487fcb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やりますね…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "744da42bbc01be20779d08218d572a4127b639b16274b57f3b81879bec673389",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9845eae4ca9b901114bcdfcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘名鑑のレベルが\r\n上がったようです。\r\n早速、ご確認を。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99a8b3136db88e00ec697b11b5a5aa3751d721a269a5345e84698b5c72bdf224",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd50141c333249b2963b8401",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次に活かしましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d9b2f15acac2d6ebc8306fcbe2917603c29461298b9688ae08c97210c0aee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5039cffe726acee761b9ad3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これが結束の力です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa149d540e853230480419b728f204fa4fe15f0a0e085ae3c22abe7b91d1a95d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb1366023e16cb44748f2106",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やりますね…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "744da42bbc01be20779d08218d572a4127b639b16274b57f3b81879bec673389",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e217bd294e089dd4925909e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次に活かしましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d9b2f15acac2d6ebc8306fcbe2917603c29461298b9688ae08c97210c0aee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2750489fd6943f8b9d45e0c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おお…スコア更新です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff0b2417dceb0f7031c39ddbc72aae3294cf382a1d59e6f32fdadc1361bd3aba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7976ac1f1a6aed7cc037effc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各自、打ち合わせ通りに。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2367b7edfae471eaa9bbd3fe84dd82e102af9a9bbf9780d3f1fe7e583120f017",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8ae39285b7adef255d13c55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2f56a6df87fc3e8c3daa12e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングですね。\r\nすべて手筈は整っております。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebeb00c89b48dafe5a85b96706038822034b5cdaab91d6e2d18113cf92d7753f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b32c366f7af9e1c10d66e4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "温故知新、過去を知ることは\r\n大変有意義かと思います。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ba035772891778554e65ac60e4567f3de06cc720fc5fb0f210b4fa74ee01b8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20e81650e5178086b40c10ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースにエントリーを？\r\n出走計画に反映しておきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba7c718b2e2dcd7a28ba0474b48df94c91d41d24bfb38a98615c6c70d3a41e09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b19f3c5dcec36b918ed05b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必ず。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a04cce7c1a8cd73007d2fd55999a750f8ed115b931b66ddec6fc88ff8a36373",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10e2c75c45dec7372abc9fed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力で。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b202728095c87fa9ec97b366968c3bee738cc377ab3fa01b771c580b8d1c1016",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5a20a018cb770a4eca1b2d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘、プリティーダービー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfce02d59976c4a687f79d00d7894df0b5a6c879fbee1d653e3f267a88ff06d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1fe9ed63584c5b2396ce022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この力は、想定外です…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e68a9312a22ad580377c6491109707867eb45e96b12f3ff9637cfc5236358e66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e565ee1973ca0c85188b7daa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本日分のログインボーナスです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0456da928551a7b666edd4d57003022fafa482851f5db144f50d9979da299133",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8801e3753491e73710247478",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ご健闘を…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30ae2d49334382fe76b92245f6e992133593babf19f7e23030d278c4d59b777d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43a9da2866020f0b2b220a3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おおっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2990e25c4ba4bddd68079b4013cbafef9f553616a3b12668e479777a8a0ca10e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab28361306fcdd15b7c20d8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d3e5f5f0582b2a21d0f86c22b551c167ae6e481619c57ccf6d904aba02eff30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e64e458321d44c24fdf15b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お見事です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71fe93f577cde2476c1cc9ea4e671a3c94f880fd16ce1f766af5b1d01e477741",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8305cb1d20e725416114ce92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんな才能をお持ちとは…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "094d7a7e07ce8d9467e6fc2ae7177f85456a0606047cd8350f2f625d393953c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
